    /// off can vary.  This function returns the minimum and maximum possible
    /// days off in any such period of length `n`.
    ///
    /// We have the well‐known facts for positive `n`:
    ///   k = n / 7   (number of full weeks),
    ///   r = n % 7   (remaining days),
    /// and therefore
    ///   min_extra = max(0, r - 5),
    ///   max_extra = min(2, r),
